ng reign that restores order</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1461</span><span class="rf-text">Emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/david">David</a> surrenders <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/trabzon">Trebizond</a> to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mehmed-ii">Mehmed II</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1463</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/david">David</a> and most of his family are executed in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/constantinople">Constantinople</a></span></li></ol>
